READING RULE
==========================================================================
  The MHC-free panel is a CLEANER PRIORITISATION, not a causally validated
  set. Colocalisation still fails for its members (10d), so no gene here
  carries a causal claim either. What the MHC-free panel does provide is a
  diagnostic model that cannot be attributed to LD with HLA-DRB1.
  Report both panels. Do not quietly replace one with the other.

